    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Jackson Merrill** (75.27) headlining our lineup. He is the clear priority play, benefiting from a soft matchup against Elder and, crucially, a slow opposing battery that provides an elite environment for his stolen base upside. Similarly, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (73.04) and **Jacob Wilson** (71.63) are must-starts. **Jacob Wilson** is particularly well-positioned; he draws a favorable matchup against Bratt, whose high 7.04 xERA suggests a high-scoring day for the middle infielder. While **Drake Baldwin** (68.13) occupies the leadoff spot with a strong xwOBA projection, his high floor makes him a stabilizer in a lineup that features some difficult matchups against elite arm talent.\n\nThe most difficult roster decision today involved **Curtis Mead** (52.30) remaining on the bench. He was the final cut, narrowly missing out due to a negative platoon split that dampened his effectiveness compared to the upside provided by **Coby Mayo** (54.83) and **Liam Hicks** (52.56). We are navigating significant headwinds elsewhere: **Luis Robert Jr.** (40.13) and **Andy Pages** (48.03) are active, but both face daunting matchups against elite pitchers with sub-3.00 xERAs. **Luis Robert Jr.** is a particular risk today, as the 2.20 xERA of Misiorowski combined with a bottom-third order placement makes him a candidate for an early hook if his efficiency metrics crater.\n\nRisk management remains a priority given the scarcity of stolen base production. We are closely monitoring the environment for **Sam Antonacci** (47.20); while his leadoff role provides a safe baseline, the matchup against deGrom is the single most dangerous assignment on our board today. If he struggles early, we will pivot to protect our daily cap. Conversely, **Nasim Nunez** (56.05) receives a significant boost from a high-run-environment park factor, and we are counting on his speed to salvage our category standing even if his raw offensive output is tempered by a ninth-place position in the order.",
